10:22:23 <Info> Welcome to the update program! (v3.2.4)
10:22:23 <Info:CommandLine> CommandLine usage: 
happygenyuanimsactupdate 
-patchAt <game_directory> 
-checkmode <0/1/2> (0 -> none, 1 -> basic check (file size), 2 -> full check (size + md5))
-zip_count <count> <zipPath1...n> 
[--config_change_guidance <true/false>] (change the showing version of official launcher, default is true)
[--delete_update_packages] (delete update packages, won't delete if the param isn't given)

e.g. happygenyuanimsactupdate -patchAt "D:\Game" -checkmode 1 -zip_count 2 "game_1_hdiff.zip" "zh-cn_hdiff.zip" --config_change_guidance false

